[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0010","text":"很好～！圆香真棒真棒！\n接下来视线看向这边……稍微笑一下……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0020","text":"（圆香并不是自己想当偶像的吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0030","text":"（………………至少，现在不是）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0040","text":"（让她走上偶像这条路，真的好吗\n　────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0050","text":"（不，别想了。继续相信直觉吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0060","text":"（……她一定，一定会）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0070","text":"──说起来，组合名字叫什么来着\n记得是，chill……chillchill……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0080","text":"noctchill……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0090","text":"我是noctchill的樋口圆香"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100100_03_0100","text":"（────成为偶像）"}]
